      "description": "Round trip for a 1-token completion against the configured extraction provider. -1 means the probe ran and failed, which is what credit exhaustion looks like: /v1/models keeps returning 200 while completions are refused. Reads stay healthy through this because the embedder is local and only extraction leaves the network.",
